From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:13:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ai): decode one frame of a video wallpaper

Backport of pctrade/end4-pC 5f1b4b4
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/commit/5f1b4b4
Problem: magick on a video decodes every frame (12.9 GB of RAM, over 10 minutes), once per wallpaper switch while aiStyling is on.
Port: clean, plus an ffmpeg presence check, the m4v, ogv, wmv and flv extensions, and no [0] suffix on the magick call; the fork comment is dropped
Drop when: the pinned gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh grabs a single frame of a video.
---
 .../ii/scripts/ai/gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh       | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/scripts/ai/gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/scripts/ai/gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh
index ead46561..55df0766 100755
--- a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/scripts/ai/gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh
+++ b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/scripts/ai/gemini-categorize-wallpaper.sh
@@ -15,7 +15,15 @@ RESIZED_IMG_PATH="/tmp/quickshell/ai/wallpaper.jpg"
 
 # Resize image for speed
 mkdir -p "$(dirname "$RESIZED_IMG_PATH")"
-magick "$SOURCE_IMG_PATH" -resize 200x -quality 50 "$RESIZED_IMG_PATH"
+case "${SOURCE_IMG_PATH,,}" in
+    *.mp4|*.webm|*.mkv|*.avi|*.mov|*.m4v|*.ogv|*.wmv|*.flv)
+        command -v ffmpeg >/dev/null || { echo "ffmpeg not found" >&2; exit 1; }
+        ffmpeg -y -loglevel error -i "$SOURCE_IMG_PATH" -frames:v 1 -vf scale=200:-2 -q:v 10 "$RESIZED_IMG_PATH"
+        ;;
+    *)
+        magick "$SOURCE_IMG_PATH" -resize 200x -quality 50 "$RESIZED_IMG_PATH"
+        ;;
+esac
 
 # Get API key
 API_KEY=$(secret-tool lookup 'application' 'illogical-impulse' | jq -r '.apiKeys.gemini')
